exports[`#1514 importVault: refusals keep their messages 1`] = `
[
  "not a directory: <root>/missing",
  "import source (<root>/vault/inner) overlaps the vault (<root>/vault) — refusing to self-ingest. The vault indexes its own files natively; importing it into itself would write a duplicate slugified copy under memories/imported/. Point \\"import vault\\" at a folder OUTSIDE the vault (or copy the notes out first).",
  "import source (<root>/vault) overlaps the vault (<root>/vault/inner) — refusing to self-ingest. The vault indexes its own files natively; importing it into itself would write a duplicate slugified copy under memories/imported/. Point \\"import vault\\" at a folder OUTSIDE the vault (or copy the notes out first)."
]
`;
